277
00:16:27,760 --> 00:16:31,150
but I've never seen anyone who could withstand this move.

278
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:35,950
It's unfortunate for this talented young man...

279
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:39,640
He thought he could force his way with just his cultivation.

280
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:42,150
Little does he know that the Demon General's power

281
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:44,350
is far more than just cultivation.

282
00:16:44,560 --> 00:16:45,630
This kid...

283
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:48,150
has brought this upon himself.

284
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:01,990
This is...

285
00:17:06,760 --> 00:17:08,790
Using the power of the Celestial Realm's palm imprint,

286
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:12,070
I will break your unyielding faith !

287
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:32,430
This spell...

288
00:17:33,360 --> 00:17:35,840
you haven't mastered it completely, have you ?

289
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:38,350
Do you...

290
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:40,870
want to try again ?

291
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:45,870
If a spell like this

292
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:48,950
were used by a Soul Transformation cultivator,

293
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:51,470
it would definitely cause an immense backlash.

294
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:54,790
That's the reason he only manifested an illusory palm.

295
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:57,750
In just a single year,

296
00:17:57,760 --> 00:18:00,350
this guy's cultivation can already rival mine.

297
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:03,350
His spells are even more unfathomable.

298
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:05,270
Demon General Mo,

299
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:07,790
can you tell me now

300
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:10,670
where Thirteen is ?

301
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:14,150
No need to be so distant.

302
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:15,390
Brother Wang,

303
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:18,030
from now on we will call each other brothers.

304
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,550
I was in seclusion

305
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:22,150
in order to refine people with strong physical bodies.

306
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:24,230
Your follower was scheduled for later

307
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:25,630
and hasn't been refined yet.

308
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:28,070
I can return him to you

309
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:30,070
but I can't overlook what you did today

310
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:32,030
by destroying the city

311
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:34,270
and killing my soldiers.

312
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:37,150
What do you want ?

313
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:38,750
In 3 months,

314
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:41,150
in Sky Demon City, the capital of the Sky Demon Country,

315
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:43,430
there will be a competition

316
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:45,550
between all the Demon Generals.

317
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:47,070
Brother Wang,

318
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:48,950
I want you to assist me.

319
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:52,670
Although this person is domineering,

320
00:18:53,440 --> 00:18:55,350
I can feel he's genuine.

321
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:57,190
Agreed.

322
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,590
From now on,

323
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:02,070
Wang Lin

324
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:04,550
is my, Mo Lihai's, First Vice-General !

325
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:09,590
If I win the Demon General Competition,

326
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:12,790
I will ask the Demon Emperor to name you his General !

327
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,950
You will command hundreds of thousands

328
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,350
and rule a city !

329
00:19:21,120 --> 00:21:25,360
"This move consumes too much of the Life Seals, it's difficult to use continuously."\NThis phrase is donghua original and makes very little sense. The Life Seals of the Celestial Slaughter Art have nothing to do with the golden symbols from the celestial cave.

330
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:32,360
I've been walking this path for endless years

331
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:32,360
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

332
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:37,960
Is it the compass of fate

333
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:37,960
that wrote this outcome for us ?

334
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:43,880
The heavens want to erase your existence,

335
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:49,600
that's the obsession guiding me.

336
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:55,200
Is this the path to uncover

337
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:55,200
truths from falsehoods ?

338
00:19:55,480 --> 00:20:00,800
In a world of murk and shadow,

339
00:19:57,380 --> 00:20:00,800
only the flame of truth can light the way.

340
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:06,520
Look at them all,

341
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:06,520
being carried by the waves.

342
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:11,160
Look at them all,

343
00:20:09,120 --> 00:20:11,160
being drowned.

344
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:14,480
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

345
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:17,560
I will let the world refine my soul.

346
00:20:17,690 --> 00:20:23,120
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

347
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:23,120
I will fight.

348
00:20:23,120 --> 00:20:26,240
I'll break through the abyss of despair

349
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:29,280
to finally learn who I really am.

350
00:20:29,280 --> 00:20:34,640
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

351
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:34,640
I embrace this obsession.

352
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:37,600
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

353
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:40,400
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

354
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:45,880
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

355
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:45,880
I'll still fight.

356
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:49,240
It's hard to avoid loneliness

357
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:52,280
when you are above everyone else.

358
00:20:52,280 --> 00:20:57,960
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

359
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:57,960
be afraid of a firefly ?

360
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:04,040
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

361
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:06,760
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

362
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:10,160
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

363
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:12,960
why the world is a-changing.

364
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:16,360
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

365
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:19,880
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

366
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:23,040
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

367
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:25,840
I will defy the light in the sky

368
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:29,560
to continue to write a new chapter\Nfor all things in the three realms of existence.

369
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:41,480
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

370
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:44,680
Transform your insignificant body into light.

371
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:47,880
The hardships of the journey

372
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:50,640
will temper this young man's heart.

373
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:54,360
The path to immortality is rugged and arduous,\Nyet I cling to dreams of the past.

374
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:06,600
If I become a Renegade Immortal,\Nwill I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
